ss=\"css-cd1uvh css-5knerd\"><div class=\"css-gy7eib css-3d8mbe css-j9f0op\"><div data-isimage=\"true\" class=\"css-roiesn css-6cnv0p\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/ffbf56050058a6ebb057261543de2c36c2bee390.svg\" alt=\"Icon: Arrow pointing to the right\" class=\"css-tzn6qh css-ez8men css-7kv4dh\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\"></div></div></div></div></button></div></div></div></div></header><section class=\"css-trufza css-v27th6 css-746m2z\"><div class=\"css-tla9nn css-5knerd\"><div class=\"css-pwy5v5 css-jo8ywo\"><div class=\"css-qs5z68 css-3hsmrm css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-9846sp css-64930d\"><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-16k724 css-m3psh8 textContents\">PLATFORM PILLARS</p></div><div class=\"css-zfhtxa css-v27th6 css-paq0kv\"><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-v27th6 css-dnv1eh css-2ky1d6 textContents\">Comprehensive Data <br aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"\">for Strategic Planning</p><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-v27th6 css-cl8dow css-lpkkoa textContents\">Identify areas needing improvement in any topic for targeted skill enhancement.</p></div><div class=\"css-7cqju2 css-v27th6 css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-lzxwn7 css-l48h1v css-atgcpy\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-150px)\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-pjr4ki css-ggwoeh css-5eam1e\"></div><div class=\"css-j71ai3 css-ob1x7v css-paq0kv\"><div data-isimage=\"true\" class=\"css-tyxwff css-wc1msa\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/0edb9096d6448630b5a777f0c2da79b37586ef4c.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"css-tzn6qh css-ez8men css-7kv4dh\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></div><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-59rdls css-lpj8kc css-2ky1d6 textContents\">Ai-powered Interview Preparation</p><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-59rdls css-3b1bro css-t3ksz0 textContents\">Max AI Coach simulates authentic interview scenarios by presenting timed questions through a video meeting. It offers immediate feedback, including detailed analysis and personalised recommendations tailored to each student's performance. Additionally, a recorded transcript of their responses is provided for review, allowing students to interpret feedback within the context of their answers.</p><div class=\"css-f1fyu4 css-1oxkje css-v27th6\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/4fec51433ea92ae6ac46f4c556ba6127c73eb375.png\" class=\"css-ez8men css-fwdtfw css-scd4s8\" width=\"394\" height=\"394\"></div></div></div><div class=\"css-iidbaz css-l48h1v css-atgcpy\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(150px)\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-pjr4ki css-ggwoeh css-5eam1e\"></div><div class=\"css-qs5z68 css-ob1x7v css-paq0kv\"><div data-isimage=\"true\" class=\"css-tyxwff css-wc1msa\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/95a586fd0671b62f794934517ba8d24f41490581.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"css-tzn6qh css-ez8men css-7kv4dh\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></div><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-59rdls css-lpj8kc css-2ky1d6 textContents\">A Holistic Evaluation Framework</p><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-59rdls css-3b1bro css-t3ksz0 textContents\">Conduct assessments for your students at any time and from any location with a diverse array of over 6,000 aptitude tests. These tests are meticulously designed to aid students in preparing for campus placements, job interviews, competitive exams such as CAT, GRE, GMAT, as well as banking and government exams, and technical assessments for prominent companies.</p><div class=\"css-tpu9su css-1oxkje css-v27th6\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/21481c4c506c4950ac91a88e3d2c15357115de26.png\" class=\"css-ez8men css-fwdtfw css-scd4s8\" width=\"394\" height=\"394\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"css-i8rt83 css-v27th6 css-nw2ez3\"><div class=\"css-tla9nn css-5knerd\"><div class=\"css-pwy5v5 css-jo8ywo\"><div class=\"css-qs5z68 css-ircyrx css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-7cqju2 css-v27th6 css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-iidbaz css-mi75ij css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-eq9jo9 css-v27th6 css-atgcpy\"><div class=\"css-qf0xdz css-2gbjjk css-j9f0op\"><div data-isimage=\"true\" class=\"css-3uq7ab css-wc1msa\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/39ff0273ac23307863cfffa9385e4ac5c36a3a87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"459\" height=\"259\" class=\"css-tzn6qh css-ez8men css-7kv4dh\"></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-6h6l83 css-d2wsbg css-ggwoeh\"></div></div><div class=\"css-5knerd css-v27th6\"><div class=\"css-rw6xdi css-paq0kv css-j9f0op\"><div class=\"css-wc1msa css-v27th6 css-6x2um4 css-t3ksz0 textContents\"><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-3vgump\">Aptitude tests &amp; Soft-skills.</p><p class=\"css-8zr56v css-59oca4 css-b54yok\">In today’s competitive job market, aptitude tests are the first filter in most hiring processes. Employers rely on these assessments to gauge problem-solving skills, logical reasoning, and mathematical ability. Performing well can open doors to top companies and career-defining opportunities.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-iidbaz css-mi75ij css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-eq9jo9 css-v27th6 css-atgcpy\"><div class=\"css-qf0xdz css-2gbjjk css-j9f0op\"><div data-isimage=\"true\" class=\"css-nld5u5 css-wc1msa\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/189e8099c6d357d12e0ad6fdd4cd93d45d182b61.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"259\" class=\"css-tzn6qh css-ez8men css-7kv4dh\"></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-6h6l83 css-d2wsbg css-ggwoeh\"></div></div><div class=\"css-5knerd css-v27th6\"><div class=\"css-rw6xdi css-paq0kv css-j9f0op\"><div class=\"css-wc1msa css-v27th6 css-6x2um4 css-t3ksz0 textContents\"><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-3vgump\">Interview Practice</p><p class=\"css-8zr56v css-59oca4 css-b54yok\">Ethical &amp; fair - Max AI is available 24/7 to interview students. AI eliminates unconscious bias in its detailed analysis of students’ performance in a real timed interview.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"css-ldv5hw css-v27th6 css-ewwzkw\"><div class=\"css-jg3xbf css-5knerd\"><div class=\"css-881fyl css-jo8ywo\"><div class=\"css-qs5z68 css-hvbvla css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-677p3g css-2fgpwh css-2gbjjk\"><div class=\"css-lfqyr5 css-1oxkje\"><div class=\"css-o7b50b css-fwdtfw\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/198d23720fe153e723a6fa9920236558b9c688c2.png\" class=\"css-trglf0 css-vqs0v5\"></div></div></div><div class=\"css-pbaulu css-2fgpwh css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-a8cjzu css-v27th6 css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-9846sp css-glygsm\"><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-16k724 css-rwap46 textContents\">BENEFITS</p></div><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-kngyoz css-fj491l css-s4mxgs textContents\">For Students</p></div><div class=\"css-whtig9 css-wc1msa css-rlek2x css-rwap46 textContents\"><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-ki8yjz\">SkillsMax.Ai helps students with their knowledge, the skills to improve and apply that knowledge, which results in increased confidence.</p><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-ki8yjz\">‍</p><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-ki8yjz\">Via the app and website:</p><ul class=\"css-ov6zdc\"><li class=\"css-h10wqm css-hd97\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Self-paced, 24/7 practice</span></li><li class=\"css-h10wqm css-hd97\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Instant AI feedback, infinite retakes</span></li><li class=\"css-h10wqm css-hd97\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Real-time coding + interactive questions</span></li><li class=\"css-h10wqm\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Job SPecific practice (MNC&nbsp;and core domain interviews)</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-jg3xbf css-5knerd\"><div class=\"css-881fyl css-jo8ywo\"><div class=\"css-qs5z68 css-hvbvla css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-pbaulu css-2fgpwh css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-a8cjzu css-v27th6 css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-9846sp css-glygsm\"><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-16k724 css-rwap46 textContents\">BENEFITS</p></div><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-kngyoz css-fj491l css-s4mxgs textContents\">For Institutions</p></div><div class=\"css-whtig9 css-wc1msa css-rlek2x css-rwap46 textContents\"><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-ki8yjz\">For institutions, SkillsMax.Ai is a tool to assist students to improve their placement opportunities. The available data can help better direct assistance efforts.</p><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-ki8yjz\">‍</p><p class=\"css-8jchzs css-ki8yjz\">Via the website:</p><ul class=\"css-ov6zdc\"><li class=\"css-h10wqm css-hd97\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Improve placement performance across all tiers</span></li><li class=\"css-h10wqm css-hd97\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Track cohort growth, identify strengths and gaps</span></li><li class=\"css-h10wqm css-hd97\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Stuctured 3-tiers upskilling model</span></li><li class=\"css-h10wqm css-hd97\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Targeted training and segmentation</span></li><li class=\"css-h10wqm\"><span class=\"css-ki8yjz\">Customisation of questions to match curriculum</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"css-677p3g css-2fgpwh css-2gbjjk\"><div class=\"css-fobw7m css-1oxkje\"><div class=\"css-o7b50b css-fwdtfw\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://skillsmax.ai/_assets/v11/5cc61abfb77f982e7125197616d3e1e588f09066.png\" class=\"css-trglf0 css-47atzv\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"css-trzvjo css-v27th6 css-hx8i5r\" id=\"education-contact\"><div class=\"css-jg3xbf css-5knerd\"><div class=\"css-pwy5v5 css-jo8ywo\"><div class=\"css-qs5z68 css-2dwg0x css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-a8cjzu css-v27th6 css-paq0kv\"><div class=\"css-9846sp css-64930d\"><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-16k724 css-m3psh8 textContents\">GET IN TOUCH</p></div><p class=\"css-nf5ac4 css-d9xgki css-r3p2t css-ip72vg textContents\">Implement SkillsMax.Ai in your institution today</p></div><div class=\"css-eq9jo9 css-v27th6 css-dslz6f\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-pjr4ki css-ggwoeh css-5eam1e\"></div><div class=\"css-z8143s css-paq0kv